title: August 2026

@pis_hearings_2026
# prose-audit: Grade B — Kaczyński, Morawiecki and the named Rozwój+ organisers now move through individual disciplinary files, the live effect on a PiS cabinet is stated, and all three Lewica responses have authored consequences; this remains the middle hearing stage of the larger rupture.
title: PiS disciplinary hearings proceed case by case
subtitle: Kaczyński can expel deputies one by one; Morawiecki still cannot transfer them by declaration
face-image: img/poland/events/jaroslaw-kaczynski-2023.webp
new-page: true
tags: poland_event, poland_event_calendar
priority: 27
order: 12
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and ((year = 2026 and month = 8) or (year = 2026 and month = 3 and rozwoj_early_route)) and rozwoj_chain_stage = 2
on-arrival: {!
const unresolved = Math.max(
    0,
    (Number(Q.rozwoj_association_members) || 0) -
        (Number(Q.rozwoj_definitive_departures) || 0)
);
const hearingBatch = Math.min(
    Q.rozwoj_split_blocked ? 0 : unresolved,
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.pis_seats) || 0),
    Math.max(6, Math.min(14, Math.round((
        (Number(Q.rozwoj_departure_pressure) || 0) +
        (Number(Q.rozwoj_party_readiness) || 0)
    ) / 7)))
);
Q.rozwoj_last_departure_batch = hearingBatch;
Q.rozwoj_definitive_departures += hearingBatch;
Q.rozwoj_cases_resolved = Math.min(
    Q.rozwoj_disciplinary_cases,
    Q.rozwoj_cases_resolved + hearingBatch
);
Q.pis_seats = Math.max(0, (Number(Q.pis_seats) || 0) - hearingBatch);
if (
    Q.government_party == "pis" && Q.government_has_confidence &&
    !Q.caretaker_government
) {
    Q.government_support_seats = Math.max(
        0,
        (Number(Q.government_support_seats) || 0) - hearingBatch
    );
    Q.coalition_seats = Math.max(
        0,
        (Number(Q.coalition_seats) || 0) - hearingBatch
    );
}
Q.rozwoj_pending_seats =
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.rozwoj_pending_seats) || 0) + hearingBatch;
Q.other_seats = Math.max(0, Number(Q.other_seats) || 0) + hearingBatch;
Q.rozwoj_chain_stage = 3;
const departureOrder = [
    "morawiecki", "semieniuk", "cieszynski", "jablonski", "kwiecien",
    "bartosik"
];
for (let index = 0; index < departureOrder.length; index += 1) {
    const person = (Q.rival_person_records || []).find(function(candidate) {
        return candidate.id == departureOrder[index];
    });
    if (!person) continue;
    if (Q.rozwoj_definitive_departures >= 4 + index * 2) {
        person.party = "independent";
        person.organisation = "rozwoj_plus";
        person.loyalty = "Rozwój+";
        person.status = "departed PiS individually";
    } else {
        person.status = "disciplinary case still pending";
    }
}
const association = (Q.rival_group_records || []).find(function(record) {
    return record.id == "rozwoj_plus";
});
if (association) association.exclusive_seats = Q.rozwoj_pending_seats;
Q.news_headline = hearingBatch +
    " more PiS cases resolve as individual departures";
!}

= August 2026 — [+ rozwoj_definitive_departures +] definitive departures

**Jarosław Kaczyński's** disciplinary officers have ruled on another **[+
rozwoj_last_departure_batch +] files**. The cases include former prime minister
<span class="party-pis"><b>Mateusz Morawiecki</b></span> and his organisers **Olga Semeniuk-Patkowska, Janusz
Cieszyński** and <span class="party-pis"><b>Paweł Jabłoński</b></span>. Each deputy leaves only after an individual
decision; nobody is transferred because Morawiecki once claimed their support.

There are now **[+ rozwoj_definitive_departures +] definitive departures**.
[? if government_party = "pis" and government_has_confidence and not
caretaker_government: Those mandates have already left the PiS cabinet's
working majority, making every absent loyalist and every Lewica coalition vote
more dangerous.?][? if government_party != "pis" or not
government_has_confidence or caretaker_government: The departures do not remove
seats from a functioning PiS majority; they divide the conservative opposition
before future confidence and budget votes.?] The association still claims more
supporters than have formally left. September will decide whether the completed
departures reach the statutory fifteen-MP club threshold.

- @pis_hearings_alliance
- @pis_hearings_attack
- @pis_hearings_recruit

@pis_hearings_alliance
title: Offer separate issue talks to PiS and the departed MPs
subtitle: Make Kaczyński and Morawiecki answer separately on wages, hospitals and the next confidence vote.
on-arrival: pis_relation += 2; coalition_opportunity_pis += 3; rozwoj_party_readiness += 2; news_headline = "Lewica recognises two negotiating tables, not two appointed leaders"

Lewica sends identical issue papers to Kaczyński's club and to the departed
deputies. Neither camp receives recognition as our preferred conservative
leader; each must put names beside votes. Morawiecki gains the treatment of a
real parliamentary interlocutor, while PiS gains proof that cooperation remains
possible if it bargains rather than commands.

- @poland_event_queue: Send both papers

@pis_hearings_attack
title: Attack both camps over their shared governing record
subtitle: Refuse to let disciplinary letters erase the Polish Deal, public-service neglect or their years in one cabinet.
on-arrival: pis_relation -= 3; rozwoj_party_readiness += 3; labor_credibility += 3; public_trust += 1; news_headline = "The PiS split fails to erase its common governing record"

Lewica places Morawiecki's premiership beside Kaczyński's party discipline and
asks both camps to defend the same record on work, tax and hospitals. Rozwój+
is denied a clean beginning, but the attack also helps it sharpen a separate
programme sooner. PiS closes ranks against us even as its hearings continue.

- @poland_event_queue: Put the record to both camps

@pis_hearings_recruit
title: Continue individual recruitment among unresolved cases
subtitle: Talk to organisers and deputies one by one; no unresolved file counts as a Lewica recruit.
on-arrival: local_network += 2; coalition_opportunity_pis += 4; rozwoj_departure_pressure += 3; news_headline = "Individual recruitment continues while hearings remain open"

Regional secretaries open talks around committee work, municipal investment and
future lists, recording each person rather than Morawiecki's claimed bloc.
Some unresolved deputies now have another reason to leave PiS; none becomes a
Lewica ally until an actual agreement is signed. The disciplinary calendar,
not our contact sheet, still decides who sits where in September.

- @poland_event_queue: Continue the conversations
